    <h2>Grow your Business, Grow your People</h2>
    <p>You're good at what you do, and your business reflects that. Growing it means bringing in people who can match the standard you've already set, and pointing them at the same goals you're working towards.</p>
    <p>CoastHR helps you hire the right people for the right roles, and align them to where your business is actually headed, not just fill a gap on the roster.</p>
