    <h2>Grow Performance</h2>
    <p>Is everyone on your team doing their best work? Feedback that hasn't happened in months? When your team's day-to-day lines up with where the business is headed, everyone knows what a good job looks like, and it's easier to spot when someone's drifted off track.</p>
    <p>CoastHR helps you align your team to your business goals, in plain English, no corporate jargon. And when someone's genuinely off track, the Performance Gap Framework gives you a clear way to fix it.</p>
    <p><a class="btn btn--gold" href="/performance-gap/">Grow your team's performance</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

