    <h2>Collaborative HR Hub</h2>
    <p>When HR questions land on your office manager's desk, are they handling them with confidence, or guessing and hoping? Untrained HR decisions cost you: compliance risk, inconsistent policies, and issues that escalate before they ever reach you.</p>
    <p>Our collaborative small-group workshops give your office manager or practice manager the knowledge and confidence to handle the people side of their role properly, backed by expert guidance when it gets tricky.</p>
